/**
 * @defgroup Starsim STARSIM Detector Simulation Framework
 * @{
 *
 * @brief GEANT3-based Monte Carlo detector simulation for the STAR experiment.
 *
 * @details
 * STARSIM (also called *atlsim*) is the full detector simulation of the STAR
 * experiment at RHIC.  It is built on CERN's GEANT 3.21 particle-transport engine
 * and augmented with:
 *
 * - The **AGE macro language** (preprocessed by `agetof`) which provides
 *   structured programming extensions to FORTRAN 77 and high-level physics
 *   abstractions.
 * - An **AGE processor model** where code is decomposed into named modules
 *   (GEOM, DIGI, RECO, …) dispatched by a KUIP command layer.
 * - The **ReBANK** library for Unix-path-addressed ZEBRA bank access.
 * - The **DZDOC** self-documenting bank system.
 * - The **COMIS** runtime interpreter for user-defined code.
 * - An optional **ROOT interface** for geometry display and event I/O.
 *
 * ## Entry point
 *
 * `main()` is in `acmain.cxx` and immediately calls the FORTRAN `AGMAIN`
 * subroutine (in `atmain/agmain.age`) which drives the full simulation lifecycle:
 * initialisation → KUIP loop → finalisation.
 *
 * ## Sub-packages
 *
 * | Module | Description |
 * |--------|-------------|
 * | @ref StarsimAtmain | Steering, GEANT hooks, KUIP interface |
 * | @ref StarsimAtgeant | GEANT interface processors |
 * | @ref StarsimAgzio | Event I/O (ZEBRA/GENZ, generators) |
 * | @ref StarsimAtutil | Tracking utilities (helix, FUMILI) |
 * | @ref StarsimRebank | ReBANK path-addressed bank access |
 * | @ref StarsimGeant | GEANT321 extensions and modifications |
 * | @ref StarsimDzdoc | ZEBRA DZDOC documentation system |
 * | @ref StarsimComis | COMIS runtime interpreter |
 * | @ref StarsimDeccc | C interface utilities |
 * | @ref StarsimAtlroot | ROOT interface |
 *
 * @}
 */

/**
 * @fn main(int argc, char* argv[])
 * @brief C++ program entry point — sets up FORTRAN `argc`/`argv` and calls `agmain_()`.
 * @param[in] argc Number of command-line arguments.
 * @param[in] argv Command-line argument strings.
 * @return 0 on normal exit (delegated to FORTRAN via `agmain_`).
 * @details
 * Sets up the argument arrays expected by several FORTRAN compiler runtimes
 * (g77, gfortran, pgf77, ifort, MIPS Fortran).  Calls `k_setar()` to register
 * arguments with KUIP, then invokes `agmain_()` to start the GEANT/KUIP loop.
 * @ingroup Starsim
 */

/**
 * @fn AVERSION()
 * @brief Records the compile-time date, time, and version string in the GEANT title common.
 * @details
 * Reads from compiler-generated include files `dateqq.inc`, `timeqq.inc`, and
 * `versqq.inc` and stores the result in `QFTITLCH` (the GEANT TITLE field).
 * @ingroup Starsim
 */
